WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Select the company logo to choose one of your accessible companies.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.708
Step 2: Open the location selector and choose the store you need. The app remembers your last location within each company during your sign-in session.

3
00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:20.708
Step 3: Check the selected company and location before entering sales, counts, orders or settings.

4
00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:26.708
Step 4: Save or discard open drafts when prompted before switching.
